{"id":3188,"date":"2017-02-06T19:36:32","date_gmt":"2017-02-07T02:36:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3188"},"modified":"2017-02-06T19:36:32","modified_gmt":"2017-02-07T02:36:32","slug":"bill-williams-river-wildlife-refuge-lake-havasu-az","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/02\/06\/bill-williams-river-wildlife-refuge-lake-havasu-az\/","title":{"rendered":"Bill Williams River Wildlife Refuge &#8211; Lake Havasu, AZ"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>We saw some beautiful sights on our way up to Parker Dam and Lake Havasu, and once we finished lunch at Lake Havasu City, Kathy suggested we work our way back down to visit the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.fws.gov\/refuge\/bill_williams_river\/\">Bill Williams River National Wildlife Refuge<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"border: 0;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/embed?pb=!1m40!1m12!1m3!1d846048.5512305865!2d-114.74743256230113!3d34.07266326543931!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!4m25!3e0!4m5!1s0x80d186930aa4d03b%3A0xd604b8c9790ffbbd!2sParker+Dam+Rd%2C+Parker%2C+AZ+85344!3m2!1d34.2902882!2d-114.13734249999999!4m5!1s0x80d1596416dd727d%3A0x907998648bdd0b32!2sQuartzsite%2C+AZ+85346!3m2!1d33.6639137!2d-114.2299486!4m5!1s0x80d1f216ee89e023%3A0x98de83cfb72ad3e2!2sLake+Havasu+City%2C+AZ!3m2!1d34.483900999999996!2d-114.32245479999999!4m5!1s0x80d22f27f1ed66e3%3A0x25f16b3f0ecc4aa2!2sBill+Williams+River+National+Wildlife+Refuge%2C+Lake+Havasu+City%2C+AZ!3m2!1d34.272715!2d-114.0458275!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1486419760131\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>It&#8217;s really a great facility with lots of paved walkways, plenty of shaded places to sit and just take in and appreciate all the different vegetation and water fowl, and enjoy all that we have to enjoy in this beautiful country of ours.<\/p>\n<p>There are 3 park host RV sites there and we talked with one of the hosts just as we were leaving. \u00a0He&#8217;s been there for a few years and does everything from taking care of the beds and the trails, watering the batteries in the solar banks, maintaining the golf carts and utility vehicles, to daily maintenance of the Visitor Center and the Education Center used by schools and other groups.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3188 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.13.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.13-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.13-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.13-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.13-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.13.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.33.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.33-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.33-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.33-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-25-12.39.33-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/